  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 15th level, your creations grasp enemies in the cold throes of winter. While a creature is under the effects of a creation you have used that either reduces its speed or incapacitates it, it suffers cold damage at the start of its turn equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). If damage would normally allow the creature to make a saving throw, this damage does not trigger such effects.</p>",
